46:52.140 --> 46:57.260
already here in this corrected form, in the calibrated form.

46:57.260 --> 47:01.380
So we can just start and take out the fundamental matrix and turn it directly into the essential

47:01.380 --> 47:02.380
matrix.

47:02.380 --> 47:07.140
So we start with X prime transposed F X double prime equals to zero, this was the basic equation

47:07.140 --> 47:09.660
that we had for the fundamental matrix.

47:09.660 --> 47:14.620
Then we just expand it according to the definition of the fundamental matrix.

