47:35.500 --> 47:42.860
So this part is nothing else than X K double prime and this part here is nothing else than

47:42.860 --> 47:46.960
X in the coordinate frame K prime transposed.

47:46.960 --> 47:54.640
So the pixel coordinate from the calibrated camera transposed and the pixel coordinate

47:54.640 --> 47:58.720
