47:58.720 --> 48:05.320
And then if I write it like this, the part which remains in the middle becomes the essential

48:05.320 --> 48:06.540
matrix.

48:06.540 --> 48:12.760
So this in here is just the rotation matrix of camera one, the skew symmetric matrix,

48:12.760 --> 48:19.680
the rotation matrix of camera two transposed becomes then the essential matrix for as the

