50:33.660 --> 50:38.980
so again one degree of freedom is gone for the scaling but it has other constraints for

50:38.980 --> 50:45.180
example there are certain constraints on the singular values that this matrix will have,

50:45.180 --> 50:48.100
something that we are going to exploit.

50:48.100 --> 50:56.060
And so the essential matrix can be used to define the coplanarity constraint similar

50:56.060 --> 51:01.540
