53:59.400 --> 54:04.780
is camera two oriented with respect to camera one and I get the direction vector with unit

54:04.780 --> 54:06.440
lengths because I don't know the scale.

54:06.440 --> 54:11.520
And again this is the standard approach that we're doing and in most of the cases you will

54:11.520 --> 54:14.720
find this type of representation.

54:14.720 --> 54:20.640
The photogrammetric representation in contrast to this is also taking the orientation into

54:20.640 --> 54:24.920
