54:36.360 --> 54:42.280
So you basically have a constant movement in the x direction between all the images.

54:42.280 --> 54:46.360
This was traditionally from the fact when you were flying, let's say, with an airplane,

54:46.360 --> 54:50.120
your camera looking downwards making photos of the ground and the airplane was moving

54:50.120 --> 54:52.800
