54:59.200 --> 55:03.240
But whenever you have vehicles which move differently, this may be a disadvantage and

55:03.240 --> 55:08.720
therefore this loses its advantages.

55:08.720 --> 55:12.600
What's kind of nice compared to the first representation here, here I basically have

55:12.600 --> 55:18.640
