55:33.960 --> 55:40.320
And then I have the parametrization with independent images, we have rotation matrix one, rotation

55:40.320 --> 55:47.760
matrix two and basically a basis of fixed lengths, of unit lengths in the direction

55:47.760 --> 55:54.960
where the first rotation matrix basically rotates the coordinate system two and I move

