because one of those rotations actually cannot determine if I basically rotate both cameras

56:10.840 --> 56:16.000
in the same way and therefore there's dependency between two of those variables.

56:16.000 --> 56:22.160
But again the most important one is the parametrization of dependent images that is frequently used.

56:22.160 --> 56:29.480
And here, so the first or the camera reference frame is defined by the first camera so there

